# Cloudflare Pages response headers (copied to build/web by `flutter build web`).
# Same frame-ancestors list as the Ionic app (vercel.json) so Microsoft Teams /
# Outlook / M365 can embed the app as a tab. Do NOT add X-Frame-Options: it
# would block those frames (frame-ancestors supersedes it).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' *.cloud.microsoft teams.microsoft.com *.teams.microsoft.com *.microsoft365.com *.office.com *.skype.com *.teams.microsoft.us *.gov.teams.microsoft.us local.teams.office.com;
